			"widgets_values":[
				"",
				", which is a digitally created line drawing. The image depicts a young woman sitting on a soft, textured carpet in a cozy indoor setting. She has long, wavy hair cascading over her shoulders and is smiling warmly at the viewer. Her attire includes a short-sleeved, off-the-shoulder blouse with a crisscross pattern on the chest and a pair of shorts. She is seated with her legs bent and her hands resting on the floor, giving her a relaxed and inviting posture. \n\nIn the background, there is a bed with a pillow and a plush blanket, suggesting a bedroom or living room. To the right of the woman, there is a small, round table with a decorative potted plant and a vintage-style alarm clock. The overall style of the drawing is clean and minimalistic, with a focus on fine line details and subtle shading to create depth and texture. The image exudes a sense of comfort and warmth, with the woman's joyful expression and the cozy surroundings contributing to a welcoming and inviting atmosphere."
